---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ToolsStrip from '../../components/ToolsStrip.astro';
---
<Base title="Free Contractual Control Tools · LandControl" description="Four free tools for the HMLR contractual control regime: agreement checker, deadline calculator, transitional period checker and readiness checklist.">
  <header class="wrap hero">
    <div class="grid">
      <p class="crumb"><a href="/">LandControl</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--red)">Tools</span></p>
      <h1>Four tools. Every answer in under a minute.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Built line by line on SI 2026/615 and HM Land Registry’s Practice guide 84. Free, no sign-up, and nothing you type leaves your browser.</p>
      <div class="facts"><div><span class="num">Cost</span><span>Free</span></div><div><span class="num">Sign-up</span><span>None</span></div><div><span class="num">Checked</span><span>Against PG 84, 26 Oct 2026</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="wrap band">
    <div class="grid">
      <ToolsStrip />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap band">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h2>Not sure which one?</h2><p class="lede">Don’t know if the agreement is caught: the checker. Know it is, need the date: the calculator. Signed before April 2027: the transitional checker. Getting a whole team ready: the checklist. Everything else is in <a href="/contractual-control-agreements/" style="color:var(--red)">the complete guide</a>.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
